WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.010
A telescope goes up in a Shuttle.

00:02.768 --> 00:09.987
The Space Shuttle Discovery left pad thirty-nine B on S T S thirty-one, to deploy the Hubble Space Telescope.

00:10.669 --> 00:17.759
To leave it in an orbit that would last, Discovery climbed to 600 km, then the highest a Shuttle had flown.
